  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> MouseEffect fields spawnTrigger,
    spawnDuringHold, holdInterval, spawnLifetime; SetTargetCamera(cam); events onSpawn,
    onStartFollow, onStopFollow. MouseInputManager.I.OnPress / OnHold / OnRelease.\n<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> [Demo] Mouse Input holds the MouseInputManager with Enable
    Hold on (hold spawning needs it). The effect toggles call GameObject.SetActive
    on the Effects children directly.\n<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b>
    Press and drag in the scene: circles, trail and follower appear; the log counts
    onSpawn."
